=base:summary.cmark
An in-browser playground for tramaj — edit a template and a JSON context, see it evaluated live.

=base:main-content.cmark

This is the same playground built from the
[tramaj](https://github.com/lucasdicioccio/tramaj) repository's PureScript
sources, published here as a static bundle so it can be tried without a
local build. It parses and evaluates tramaj templates in the browser —
nothing is sent to a server. Tabs act as importable libraries for each
other; toggle "Symbolic mode" to see the v3 envelope instead of a finished
document.

See [Getting started](/howto-humans.html) for running the same language
from the command line, or [Use cases](/use-cases.html) for where it fits.

<iframe class="playground-frame" src="/tramaj-playground.html" title="tramaj playground"></iframe>

If the embedded frame does not load, open the
[playground](/tramaj-playground.html) directly.

